# Vulnerabilities accepted for the released binary, reviewed on each addition.
# Format: one advisory ID per line. Remove an entry the moment a fix ships.

# golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is unmaintained and unsafe by design, with no
# fixed version upstream. It reaches the binary only as an unused sibling of
# golang.org/x/crypto/pbkdf2, which OPA pulls in through lestrrat-go/jwx for
# JWE decoding. TerraTidy never imports or executes any openpgp code path.
GO-2026-5932
